[{"title":"余入广始见乡士刘养正于晋归 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"转蓬同到岭南州，黄菊茱萸三送秋。\n东道虽青开阁眼，西风恐白倚门头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77431,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余入广始见乡士刘养正于晋归 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"好景番禺能几何，簿书不许我吟哦。\n绛纱帐里事浑少，古锦囊中诗定多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77432,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余入广始见乡士刘养正于晋归 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"里社闻名已数年，恨无倾盖盍簪缘。\n子初游学吾游宦，一笑相逢韶石边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77433,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得石山二座西南道李监场索之附海船归三山 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"圆峤方壶共五山，上随潮往下随还。\n二山流落初何在，新喜归吾几案间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77434,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得石山二座西南道李监场索之附海船归三山 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"长料负山人不多，眼中今失两嵯峨。\n非渠偶有夸娥力，如我太行王屋何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77435,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得石山二座西南道李监场索之附海船归三山 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"君今得我玉嶙峋，附搭东艘过七闽。\n且试挟山超海手，休为负石蹈河人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77436,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得石山二座西南道李监场索之附海船归三山 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"初得两山排闼来，满期突兀老相陪。\n忽如双剑擅飞去，疑是六丁争取回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77437,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得石山二座西南道李监场索之附海船归三山 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"浙峰既有飞来者，菱石能无取去人。\n来去傥然均一理，欧公何苦把眉颦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77438,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得英州石山副之五绝句送曾鼎臣 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"吾宗世住望仙村，华盖峥嵘日在门。\n忽得祝融尤可重，方知华盖未为尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77439,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得英州石山副之五绝句送曾鼎臣 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"湖上飞来小祝融，群青在侧一居中。\n何当容众常相下，不必称孤独自雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77440,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得英州石山副之五绝句送曾鼎臣 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"岩岩迥不与凡同，骨有馀清岂久穷。\n雅趣未应为独行，皇恩犹许是三公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77441,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得英州石山副之五绝句送曾鼎臣 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"梦不曾为岭表游，眼中陡顿有英州。\n知君结此石交后，一洗从前势利羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77442,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余得英州石山副之五绝句送曾鼎臣 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"小山欲与岳为曹，其末虽危本则牢。\n屹立挺身行所独，旁罗垂首让其高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77443,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余蓄石屏风十游稚宜喜而求之辄遗其一侑以五绝 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"巨灵神手造江山，潜写为图置石间。\n岁久石为图所变，一重峦下一重湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77444,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余蓄石屏风十游稚宜喜而求之辄遗其一侑以五绝 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"后土心恬不爱奇，祁阳人故得私之。\n我新取道祁阳过，鬼发其藏使见随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77445,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余蓄石屏风十游稚宜喜而求之辄遗其一侑以五绝 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"大道要为天下公，割吾所爱以归侬。\n北窗不在西湖上，惊见飞来湖上峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77446,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余蓄石屏风十游稚宜喜而求之辄遗其一侑以五绝 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"月走地中忙丧精，化为异石琢为屏。\n其中幻画山河影，不止数峰江上青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77447,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈罗叔异 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"吾疑子亦惯乘机，乃枉华轩扣竹扉。\n不是梅花不相外，囊犹未瘿若为归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77448,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈罗叔异 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"崆峒不合识东坡，骄气百年犹未磨。\n今放晴烟弄寒影，安知非喜子相过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77449,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈罗叔异 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"浪把柴扉为客开，揖馀茶速又汤催。\n应门老走忽解意，放入江西风月来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77450,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙山孙元济建阁江濒以馆往来士大夫余取韩文公瞰临眇空阁之句题以眇空赋三绝句 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"真空元在我胸中，自外观之枉费功。\n熟视主人参透处，也无实相也无空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77451,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙山孙元济建阁江濒以馆往来士大夫余取韩文公瞰临眇空阁之句题以眇空赋三绝句 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"未惯观空空可观，更参向上一机关。\n大通与我合为一，眼自有馀空自悭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77452,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙山孙元济建阁江濒以馆往来士大夫余取韩文公瞰临眇空阁之句题以眇空赋三绝句 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"万里江山绕画栏，要犹未离色尘间。\n眼高更不著群有，独与太空相往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77453,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张仲山补试余调官皆不得意相会次一咏","author":"曾丰","text":"君自战馀成眊氉，吾行到处得揶揄。\n两穷邂逅空相视，只问归时有信无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77454,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张彦容病未安却问余病就报之","author":"曾丰","text":"误把维摩作病看，不知自欠起羸丸。\n殷勤浪说安心法，将取心来与汝安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77455,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戒永州道闻思归乐 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"田园无力办难俱，有益犹堪学把锄。\n二者即今皆未具，教吾归去却何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77456,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戒永州道闻思归乐 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"张翰陶潜出信缘，思莼爱菊返丘园。\n帝魂已托杜鹃去，今汝宁非二子魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77457,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戒永州道闻思归乐 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"宦游佳处是零陵，廪稍优饶水石清。\n心不思归归不乐，汝休强劝拂人情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77458,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"社鼠","author":"曾丰","text":"依附宜灵寖陆梁，乘人切忌肆为殃。\n不知猫在旁窥伺，才堕其机辄中肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77459,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其七","author":"曾丰","text":"南海江山郁所怀，今晨何喜夙容开。\n一千里外行人报，二十年前知己来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77460,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其六","author":"曾丰","text":"农瓶无粟可重搜，官帑钱犹地上流。\n望我方来观俗使，从今且作富民侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77461,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"入境诹民察吏馀，罗浮赏罢更丰湖。\n相迎鱼鸟如相告，车骑今回又较都。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77462,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"星屏熊轼两从容，未始论功莫大功。\n南剑人人无剑气，宜春在在有春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77463,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"一尉初收百里尘，一同寻访万家春。\n留中幸到争先处，请外甘为勇退人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77464,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"二十馀年两度来，来宾莲幕主霜台。\n今吾犹是故吾尔，白眼岂须青眼哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77465,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其八","author":"曾丰","text":"同游漕幕旧三宾，台府两为新主人。\n应念江西撙斋老，长裾犹曳幕中尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77466,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迎仓使李监丞八绝 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"妙龄徒手掇科名，发轫风云九万程。\n捷径何妨聊决起，通途自分且徐行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77467,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈伯纪列岫 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"文书倥偬汗模糊，问有清凉世界无。\n走借主人烟雨观，幻吾身眼入冰壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77468,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈伯纪列岫 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"江濒湱湱不容暑，竹杪骚骚那揽尘。\n只隔一重窗纸影，蚤分俗客与幽人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77469,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈伯纪列岫 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"一塔数椽崖半腰，工夫草草意翛翛。\n青山虽老犹儿态，邂逅吾人喜饮醪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77470,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"始生之日有笼禽而献者口占一绝放之","author":"曾丰","text":"汤网恢疏未弃捐，绛纱宠里是壶天。\n倘来富贵曾聊尔，归去山林乃自然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77471,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗子琳谒赵香山得钱十缗米三石意若未满以诗见报为赋四绝 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"广文郑子橐虽枵，司业苏君惠已饶。\n未到多多堪塞屋，也须仅仅得缠腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77472,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗子琳谒赵香山得钱十缗米三石意若未满以诗见报为赋四绝 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"鲁公乞米出于真，邂逅周瑜慷慨人。\n借谓囊犹未为瘿，悬知甑已不生尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77473,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗子琳谒赵香山得钱十缗米三石意若未满以诗见报为赋四绝 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"主人长念客鸣肠，况复花封是稻乡。\n指廪何疑犹出手，归艘岂患不连樯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77474,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试宜黄侯湛墨 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"逢时不敢爱玄香，摹写尧文重舜章。\n天地已归经纬里，豹囊深处自含光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77475,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试宜黄侯湛墨 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"誇灶传家祖赤松，吹烟授道悟元宗。\n初怀不拟潘衡贡，晚趣宁便薛稷封。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77476,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试胡梦传笔 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"用从书契到于今，万世功名一洗心。\n甘与墨卿绝交后，管城萧散退藏深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77477,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"试胡梦传笔 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"毛公委质应时须，管子知心受以虚。\n容到中书黄纸上，管教一字一华胥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77478,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城狐","author":"曾丰","text":"凭高负固恣为妖，自谓身安物莫摇。\n薰灌幸人俱有忌，不知鹰犬不相饶。","colle